{"4740010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bodian's Bay Wash", "steam_appid": 4740010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Bodião's Wash!</strong> A relaxing VR cleaning simulator with Tycoon elements. Find peace at the bottom of the sea while doing the dirty work and upgrading your very own wash station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Manual Labor in VR:</strong> Feel the reward of a job well done with your own hands. Use the water gun to clean off the fine dirt and wield your scraper to forcefully pry off barnacles. Master your tools to get the job done and leave everything sparkling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in Your Business:</strong> All of your hard work generates profit. Use the money from your services to buy furniture and improve your space. A beautiful and well-equipped wash attracts top-tier clients and unlocks new technologies to make your day-to-day life easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Clients:</strong> The routine at the bottom of the sea is never the same. Start by cleaning small motorboats and harmless rafts. As you expand your space and purchase new licenses, the ocean will send you an incredible diversity of jobs, ranging from unusual boats to gigantic wildlife in need of a good scrub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Our Plans and Dreams for the Future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sincere note about the scope of the game 📝Bodian's Bay Wash</strong> is a 100% Brazilian indie game, literally born out in the woods and built from scratch over 4 months of hard work and sweat. The entire team consists of a solo developer handling all the coding/VR and an incredible concept artist bringing the project to life visually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be completely transparent: this is a short game. Our current release delivers the maximum amount of content our hands could produce in that time (around 8 hours of gameplay for those who want to clean everything and decorate the entire base). We decided to release what was possible within our current reality. If the community embraces the game and the reception is positive, our biggest dream is to expand, create new clients, and add more content in the future! But, for now, come for what it already is: a focused, relaxing experience made with a lot of love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the community embraces <i>Lava Jato do Bodião</i> and gives us the breathing room needed to keep expanding, we have a notebook full of ideas that we want to turn into reality in future updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodião's Past:</strong> We want to deeply develop Bodião's own lore. Who is he? How did he end up running an underwater car wash?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories and Connections:</strong> Much more than just dirty hulls! We plan to create unique stories for every client that docks at your base. We want you to build bonds, converse, and discover the depth of each character that visits your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering and Fishing:</strong> Introduce harpoon fishing and resource gathering systems around the environment, plus a codex for clients and animals, expanding the gameplay beyond just cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A More Alive Ocean:</strong> A greater variety of marine life swimming around your base, bringing the environment to life, along with new animations and specific interaction and cleaning mechanics for these colossal creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Car Wash's Evolution:</strong> New progression levels, more options to expand the floating base, and a shop filled with new upgrades and furniture for you to flaunt your success across the seven seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/122734de40384880d884fb66d8fa1954.avif?t=1787421684\" width=346 height=346 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Bodião's Wash!</strong> A relaxing VR cleaning simulator with Tycoon elements. Find peace at the bottom of the sea while doing the dirty work and upgrading your very own wash station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/745ae0583752d04cc00814e12ee2cb1f.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Manual Labor in VR:</strong> Feel the reward of a job well done with your own hands. Use the water gun to clean off the fine dirt and wield your scraper to forcefully pry off barnacles. Master your tools to get the job done and leave everything sparkling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/a9d00658148cde3490c0178428130bcb.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in Your Business:</strong> All of your hard work generates profit. Use the money from your services to buy furniture and improve your space. A beautiful and well-equipped wash attracts top-tier clients and unlocks new technologies to make your day-to-day life easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/ff46f0ac56959e2a49bc075a15c18fea.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Wide Variety of Clients:</strong> The routine at the bottom of the sea is never the same. Start by cleaning small motorboats and harmless rafts. As you expand your space and purchase new licenses, the ocean will send you an incredible diversity of jobs, ranging from unusual boats to gigantic wildlife in need of a good scrub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.poster.avif?t=1787421684\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.webm?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/549e3f2923af9ce19a17e2aaba7eaf5d.mp4?t=1787421684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 <strong>Our Plans and Dreams for the Future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sincere note about the scope of the game 📝Bodian's Bay Wash</strong> is a 100% Brazilian indie game, literally born out in the woods and built from scratch over 4 months of hard work and sweat. The entire team consists of a solo developer handling all the coding/VR and an incredible concept artist bringing the project to life visually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be completely transparent: this is a short game. Our current release delivers the maximum amount of content our hands could produce in that time (around 8 hours of gameplay for those who want to clean everything and decorate the entire base). We decided to release what was possible within our current reality. If the community embraces the game and the reception is positive, our biggest dream is to expand, create new clients, and add more content in the future! But, for now, come for what it already is: a focused, relaxing experience made with a lot of love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the community embraces <i>Lava Jato do Bodião</i> and gives us the breathing room needed to keep expanding, we have a notebook full of ideas that we want to turn into reality in future updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodião's Past:</strong> We want to deeply develop Bodião's own lore. Who is he? How did he end up running an underwater car wash?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories and Connections:</strong> Much more than just dirty hulls! We plan to create unique stories for every client that docks at your base. We want you to build bonds, converse, and discover the depth of each character that visits your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering and Fishing:</strong> Introduce harpoon fishing and resource gathering systems around the environment, plus a codex for clients and animals, expanding the gameplay beyond just cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A More Alive Ocean:</strong> A greater variety of marine life swimming around your base, bringing the environment to life, along with new animations and specific interaction and cleaning mechanics for these colossal creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Car Wash's Evolution:</strong> New progression levels, more options to expand the floating base, and a shop filled with new upgrades and furniture for you to flaunt your success across the seven seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4740010/extras/122734de40384880d884fb66d8fa1954.avif?t=1787421684\" width=346 height=346 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>", "short_description": "A relaxing underwater VR cleaning simulator! Use pressure washers and scrapers to clean boat hulls, smash barnacles, and expand your very own underwater wash. Buy furniture, upgrade your equipment, and get ready for clients of colossal proportions!", "supported_lan